{
 "id": "a14",
 "error_class": "equilibrium",
 "expected_check": "equilibrium",
 "assigned_role": "firmware",
 "description": "With the motors at the full 7.2 V, mechanical.gearboxes torque_peak rises to 132 kgf*cm, but reaction_moment on the same node is left at 110 kgf*cm with the 6 V derivation [R1.07] * [R2.11]. The housing reaction must balance the output torque, so it should be 132 kgf*cm. As written, the moments on each gearbox leave a residual of 22 kgf*cm, about 2.16 N*m. The chassis mounts would be sized for a reaction 17 per cent below the real one.",
